{
  "sequence_id": "seq_98d98dac2a89a339",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I'm trying my best to not just cause problems..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "For sense!, but..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "How about your \"friends\"?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It seems none of the others except the \"Squad leader\" have come to have their blood drawn?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...the same as usual."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Everyone is going at their own pace."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I'll tell everyone."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Tell sasaki-kun properly too."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The squad leader and Shirazu-kun are both on independent investigations, aren't they...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I wonder if saiko-chan... oversleept again..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Even though sensei told everyone to cooperate..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "WELL, BUT, EVEN IF I TELL THEM THEY WON'T LISTEN TO ME ANYHOW..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Ouch!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "AH..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'm sorry ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...a guy from the \"Newly established unit\"?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...Looks so weak."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Those guys are our, the Hirako Squad's, rivals?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I don't want them looking down on us."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Now, now, I told you \"please get along\", since they are our com- rades."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "THEY ARE A SCARY SQUAD IN \"SEVERAL WAYS\"..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Well,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I don't know what the higher ups are thinking."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "So, how about it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What about that \"newly established unit\"?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "“The problem is that we are not going to be able to"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Nah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Considering all the fanfare when it was established,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It seems like it isn't going to produce any results at all."
    }
  ],
